        "pointer": "/prose/7/text",
        "action": "In the affected author's future writable candidate only, add a brief clarification before the first arc formula: the angle factor uses radians, defined by arc length divided by radius, not an angle in degrees. Explain the unfamiliar measure in child-readable Chinese; preserve all existing formula tokens, values and source snapshots.",
        "suggestedMeaningNotApplied": "式中的角度因子用弧度表示：用弧长除以半径来量出角的大小，而不是直接使用度数。"
      },
